oraj brez omejitev. 5-sedežnik: klop pomaknite za 3 zareze naprej, sicer kletka stoji na plastični letvi in se prtljažnik ne zapre."],["N93 N94 N95","adapt","Globina 100 cm, višina 62,5 cm, velika prostornina – največja izraba prtljažnika. Klop pomaknite za 4 zareze naprej, naslonjala za 3 zareze bolj strmo."]]]],"i":["Med 7-sedežnikom in 5-sedežnikom z dvignjenim dnom (ravna površina, brez roba) ni razlike. Pred nakupom preverite položaj sedežev v vozilu."],"p":{"N2":[["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_AB3199-0164DD-F027B8-B22450-47AE76-1C1F52.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_EE25EE-7271A8-B1E718-526E69-9C4DEC-19A9CE.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_64A5D4-57BCF9-0FBB32-276DD9-3584F7-2AF780.jpg"]],"N3":[["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_43E192-B1657B-6FCF7A-8E87FC-B7C4FA-F48EEC.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_54E318-E02379-215B3C-FFC4CF-723A7E-4133EB.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_BBB8C0-1480F3-595163-F0776F-E5FFC6-14E0B6.jpg"]],"N40":[["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_455D1D-EE560A-DEB605-180137-78981D-CCBDE7.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_E0153D-4FD0F0-0A519F-5E0FD2-D83330-6E3D96.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_B42979-BC3E9B-9C60B9-74E653-86BAD2-6AB8A3.jpg"]],"N41":[["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_BE9A7C-AD2948-816906-DBC36D-C2157F-0F152A.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_FBEB4F-99F2AB-FE491E-E77192-289E39-F342DE.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_F36AB8-9FF5C3-56E13C-2D8B83-A8D888-692C72.jpg"]],"N42":[["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_BAA397-68EF41-F76CAD-217BF1-96D195-6CC369.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_55FC86-7EFD49-BF604C-D06B86-3EFFB5-C226A1.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_721995-3D3F48-500DAD-9A47C2-906CDB-0F6590.jpg"]],"N43":[["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_25D150-305038-A3CC1F-774E95-BA891A-FDBB95.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_2FA12F-75BA33-91B576-03B101-C7E6FD-C80B9D.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_E3298E-89CDE3-8A02E8-99C689-2F35F2-1A25ED.jpg"]],"N44":[["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_8B5EA0-E8697E-8E7371-9CE549-4D84ED-5231DB.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_459CB5-04615F-A53DCC-FA734D-600A2C-2E39A3.jpg"],["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_CD8F02-63A24E-028CC9-E1749F-1518F6-80F453.jpg"]],"N45":[["Seat_Tarraco/IMG_F05A63-395DC0-4575F9-092954-F09AC0-D96B48.jpg